# mutgap_svc_placement_removed: SetObjectAndPlacementList (68) with a placement list at VA page 4, then again with none (offset and length 0). With argument buffers (the service) the first maps the placement list writable; the second has no new list to copy the old one into and needs none, so it completes, and the task root keeps the object list and zero placement fields. In-process the manager has no argument buffers and records only the object list. An exec then runs through the object list.
